# University Course Management System

A React-based University Course Management System developed using React, Context API, React Router, and localStorage.

## Features

* Add and delete students
* Add and delete courses
* Enroll students into courses
* View all enrollments
* Student detail page
* Search students
* Prevent duplicate enrollments
* Responsive user interface
* localStorage data persistence

## Technologies Used

* React + Vite
* React Router DOM
* Context API
* JavaScript
* CSS

## Project Structure

```bash
src/
├── components/
├── context/
├── pages/
├── App.jsx
├── main.jsx
└── index.css
```

## Installation

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

